				<div class="leftcol game_description_column"  data-panel="{&quot;flow-children&quot;:&quot;column&quot;}" >

					
												<div id="earlyAccessHeader" class="early_access_header">
		<div class="heading">
												<h2 class="inset">Early Access Game</h2>
					<p class="inset subtitle">Get instant access and start playing; get involved with this game as it develops.</p>
				
				<p><span>Note:</span> Games in Early Access are not complete and may or may not change further. If you are not excited to play this game in its current state, then you
									should wait to see if the game progresses further in development. <a href="https://store.steampowered.com/earlyaccessfaq/?snr=1_5_9_">Learn more</a></p>
					</div>
				<div id="earlyAccessBody" class="devnotes">
							<div class="devs_say">What the developers have to say:</div>
			
			<div id="devnotes_expander">
									<h3>Why Early Access?</h3>
					“We want to release the Early Access version in order to gather information from players. In order to see what kind of adjustment we can do to make the gamer better. ”
					<h3>Approximately how long will this game be in Early Access?</h3>
					“About 6 to 12 months”
					<h3>How is the full version planned to differ from the Early Access version?</h3>
					“We will bring in more content, including device, monsters, environment, characters in the future. And we will update the current version in order to make it more interesting. The entire plan for our game is to complete 6 biomes, and we have already done 4 of them. ”
					<h3>What is the current state of the Early Access version?</h3>
					“The structure is already in a decent level. We are not going to do any big changes on our gameplay. The content we have for the EA version is about 70% of the whole game we planned. So we planned to create more content for the future update, but the whole game experience can already be known by this EA version. At the moment, we have 4 different biomes. Each biome includes 3 different scene with unique enemies and environment. And we have more than 30 characters, 100 relics and 60 device to play with. It will take players at least 15-18 hours to complete the current version.”
					<h3>Will the game be priced differently during and after Early Access?</h3>
					“No. All the following update until the full version will be free to the players.”
					<h3>How are you planning on involving the Community in your development process?</h3>
					“We will run the media platforms to gather information. And for any problems like bugs or suggestions, players can also email to us.”
							</div> <!-- /devnotes_expander -->
			<a class="morebutton" id="devnotes_more" href="#"  onclick="$J('#devnotes_expander').css({'max-height': 'none'}); $J(this).hide(); return false;">Read more</a>
		</div>
	</div>
										
					
